;===========================================================================
; AD BYZANTINE MASTER AI - PRIVATE STRATEGIC CONSTANTS
; File: ADPromisory\ADByzantineConstants.per
;
; This file contains ONLY Byzantine-AI symbolic constants.
; It deliberately does not redefine engine FactIds, ObjectIds, SNs, Goals,
; Actions, Orders, or unit IDs from the stock Promisory framework.
;
; Safe design rule:
;   - values below are symbolic state/category values only
;   - do not use these numbers directly as strategic-number IDs or goal IDs
;   - create dedicated engine goal/SN IDs only after the existing namespace
;     has been audited
;===========================================================================

